# Legacy test result artifacts — re-mask after broad 'aura' rule was
# narrowed to '/aura' (Phase 2A 2026-04-30). These per-binary `aura/`
# subdirectories under legacy/tests-results/ are pre-built binary
# snapshots from earlier measurement runs (Phase F / v2.1.0 / v2.3.0
# regression baselines), not source.
legacy/tests-results/**/aura/

